# No bridge answers (ue): scan mode for good; boot at 720p, the host moves to 1080p.
chip ue
board beta
file /etc/kvm/hdmi_mode 0
file /kvmapp/kvm/state 0\n
file /kvmapp/kvm/width 1920\n
file /kvmapp/kvm/height 1080\n
vidbg auto
src 1280 720
call init
at 500
call mjpeg 1280 720 80 every 500 until 20000
at 20000
src 1920 1080
at 20100
call mjpeg 1920 1080 80 every 500 until 50000
at 50000
end
